Persona-Fuzz
Copyright 2026 Persona-Fuzz contributors

This product includes software and data from the projects below.

NVIDIA Nemotron-Personas-India
- Source: https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/Nemotron-Personas-India
- Used to seed synthetic persona descriptions (config en_IN, streaming).
- Dataset card terms must be reviewed before redistribution. Nemotron persona
  rows are not committed to this repository. The committed fallback personas
  are generated locally, follow the schema, and are flagged as synthetic.

AgentDojo
- Source: https://github.com/ethz-spylab/agentdojo
- Research design inspiration for utility-under-attack and state-based checks.
- No AgentDojo code is vendored.

Progent
- Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.11703
- Research design inspiration for tool-level privilege policies. No code vendored.

NVIDIA garak
- Source: https://github.com/NVIDIA/garak
- Optional, import-time adapter for injection payload seeds. Not bundled.

NVIDIA OpenShell
- Documentation: https://docs.nvidia.com/openshell/latest/reference/policy-schema.html
- Policy YAML export targets the documented sandbox policy schema. OpenShell is
  not bundled and is not required at runtime.

Nebius Token Factory / Nebius Serverless AI Jobs
- Used as hosted inference and optional batch compute providers. Credentials are
  supplied by the operator through environment variables and are never stored in
  this repository.
